OL,3,AReading and Leeds Festival unveils
OL,4,Amajor overhaul, but will it draw in a
OL,5,Anew crowd?
OL,6,
OL,7,FReading and Leeds Festival is unveiling
OL,8,Fwhat organisers say is the "biggest
OL,9,Fstaging and arena overhaul" in its
OL,10,Fhistory this weekend.
OL,12,FChanges include revamping the look of
OL,13,Fsome major stages, while other spaces,
OL,14,Fsuch as a campsite for over-21s, are
OL,15,Fbeing introduced for the first time.
OL,17,FOrganisers Festival Republic say this
OL,18,Fwill take the festival "firmly into its
OL,19,Fnext evolution".
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,165,160,200,105,0,100
