OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AReading and Leeds Festival unveils
OL,4,Amajor overhaul, but will it draw in a
OL,5,Anew crowd?
OL,6,
OL,7,FBBC Newsbeat has spoken with
OL,8,Ffestival-goers and an artist to see
OL,9,Fwhether they feel this shake-up will
OL,10,Fattract a wider demographic, as some
OL,11,Fsay it has developed an image of
OL,12,Fattracting a younger crowd, putting off
OL,13,Fsome older music fans.
